{"4511440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cypherpunk", "steam_appid": 4511440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cypherpunk</strong> is a visceral, narrative-driven first-person shooter infused with deeply unsettling psychological horror. Set in a dystopian metropolis governed by an all-seeing, algorithmic oligarchy, you play as Null, a rogue cryptographic specialist and black-market data runner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a routine heist of an encrypted &quot;ghost drive&quot; goes catastrophically wrong, you don’t just steal data—you ingest it. Now, hunted by corporate kill-squads and haunted by the fractured digital consciousness trapped inside your mind, you must fight your way through the neon-drenched underbelly of the city while struggling to determine what is real, and what is merely a glitch in your perception.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis: The War for Your Mind</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the city of Enclave-09, privacy is a death sentence. The corporate conglomerate <i>OmniSight</i> monitors every heartbeat, retinal scan, and synaptic firing. The only resistance left is the Cypherpunks—underground hackers and gunrunners fighting for absolute encryption and cognitive freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After uploading a corrupted, forbidden encryption key directly into your neural implant, reality begins to splinter. The environment shifts seamlessly from gritty, industrial corridors to surreal, nightmarish digital voids. The voice in your head isn't yours anymore, and the shadows around the corner are taking shape. To survive, you must use a deadly arsenal of firearms  to decrypt the truth before your sanity hits zero.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cypherpunk</strong> is a visceral, narrative-driven first-person shooter infused with deeply unsettling psychological horror. Set in a dystopian metropolis governed by an all-seeing, algorithmic oligarchy, you play as Null, a rogue cryptographic specialist and black-market data runner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a routine heist of an encrypted &quot;ghost drive&quot; goes catastrophically wrong, you don’t just steal data—you ingest it. Now, hunted by corporate kill-squads and haunted by the fractured digital consciousness trapped inside your mind, you must fight your way through the neon-drenched underbelly of the city while struggling to determine what is real, and what is merely a glitch in your perception.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis: The War for Your Mind</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the city of Enclave-09, privacy is a death sentence. The corporate conglomerate <i>OmniSight</i> monitors every heartbeat, retinal scan, and synaptic firing. The only resistance left is the Cypherpunks—underground hackers and gunrunners fighting for absolute encryption and cognitive freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After uploading a corrupted, forbidden encryption key directly into your neural implant, reality begins to splinter. The environment shifts seamlessly from gritty, industrial corridors to surreal, nightmarish digital voids. The voice in your head isn't yours anymore, and the shadows around the corner are taking shape. To survive, you must use a deadly arsenal of firearms  to decrypt the truth before your sanity hits zero.</p>", "short_description": "In a world where your thoughts are backed up to the cloud, the ultimate horror isn't dying. It's being rewritten.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511440/5c0ce21eeda787e73d6e6d645bbbb41b97ab285e/header.jpg?t=1786365788", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511440/bdbe4db08f6a8b5ed612eff0bdc057b8a25